taff only call Customer methods;&lt;br&gt;getSatisfactionLossPerTurn() / getTypeName() are&lt;br&gt;abstract; calculateBill() is an overridable hook.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Encapsulation&lt;/b&gt;: all state is private; mutators are&lt;br&gt;package-private (~) and called only by staff / Restaurant&lt;br&gt;after checking the rules (requireStatus())." style="shape=note;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;size=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;fontSize=10;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2000" y="730" width="311" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n303" style="endArrow=none;dashed=1;html=1;strokeColor=#999999;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n302" target="n126"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n304" value="&lt;b&gt;Encapsulation&lt;/b&gt;: priceCents is final and set in the&lt;br&gt;constructor = price locked when the order is taken.&lt;br&gt;Constructor is package-private: only Waiter creates orders." style="shape=note;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;size=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;fontSize=10;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="3280" y="456" width="322" height="54" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n305" style="endArrow=none;dashed=1;html=1;strokeColor=#999999;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n304" target="n192"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n306" value="&lt;b&gt;Composition&lt;/b&gt;: Restaurant creates and owns&lt;br&gt;its Tables and its staff.&lt;br&gt;Customers and Menu are shared (aggregation)." style="shape=note;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;size=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;fontSize=10;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="787" y="110" width="263" height="54" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n307" style="endArrow=none;dashed=1;html=1;strokeColor=#999999;" edge